# --- icculus harness ---
# CLAUDE.md is a compiled artifact of .ai/guidelines/* (regenerated by
# `agent guidelines`). AGENTS.md is intentionally left tracked so changes to the
# compiled guidance still show up in diffs and review.
/CLAUDE.md
# Everything under .claude/ is generated or ephemeral — the skill symlinks
# compiled by `agent guidelines`, and the linked worktree checkouts created by
# the worktree hooks — EXCEPT your settings, which are tracked. (Leaving the
# worktree checkouts tracked would make the main checkout read "dirty" the
# moment a worktree is created, blocking graduation.)
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
!/.claude/settings.local.json
# Per-branch work evidence captured by the gate (runtime store, not source).
.icculus/evidence/
